{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qI9WJz0B0k1794492590.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部回應傳媒提問，關於中美俄元首會否在深圳APEC峰會期間會晤，指中方同有關方保持著溝通。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧稱：「中方就中俄美元首會晤，同有關方保持著溝通。如果有進一步的信息，我們會及時發布。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.365083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:46:32.734756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:31.459002+00:00","content_hash":"ce4792befecdb547cc5c5e55091fa994447045fb750daecf2fbb410232f1fd26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}